Set-MpPreference -EnableControlledFolderAccess Enabled

Add protected folder: 

Add-MpPreference -ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders "C:\ImportantData" 

Allow app: 

Add-MpPreference -ControlledFolderAccessAllowedApplications "C:\Tools\CustomApp.exe"


View current settings: 

Get-MpPreference | Select-Object ControlledFolderAccess*,ControlledFolderAccessAllowedApplications,ControlledFolderAccessProtectedFolders
